  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supervision of Works for Construction of small-scale Irrigation Systems in Municipalities of North Macedonia - Phase II, Republic of North Macedonia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of this contract is as follows: Provide services for the supervision of the construction works of three small scale irrigation systems  Tearce in Municipality of Tearce (LOT 1), Pishica in Municipality of Probitip (LOT 2) and Konopnica in Municipality of Kriva Palanka (LOT 3).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
